<===> README.md
Compressed output of selectors and at-rules like dart-sass: no whitespace
around selector combinators (`a>b`), `@import` without whitespace and
with `url()` replaced by a string (`@import"foo.css"`), no space after
`@supports` and `@media` if a parenthesis follows, and media conditions
joined with `and ` (no space before). Expected output generated with
dart-sass 1.93.1.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> combinator/after_attribute/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> combinator/after_attribute/input.scss
[data-x="a b"] > e {x: 1}
<===> combinator/after_attribute/output.css
[data-x="a b"]>e{x:1}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> combinator/descendant/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> combinator/descendant/input.scss
.l .m > .n + .o ~ .p {x: 1}
<===> combinator/descendant/output.css
.l .m>.n+.o~.p{x:1}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> combinator/in_pseudo/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> combinator/in_pseudo/input.scss
a b:not(c > d) {x: 1}
<===> combinator/in_pseudo/output.css
a b:not(c>d){x:1}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> combinator/nested/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> combinator/nested/input.scss
a {
  > b {x: 1}
  + c ~ d {x: 2}
}
.h {
  & > .i,
  & ~ .j {x: 3}
}
<===> combinator/nested/output.css
a>b{x:1}a+c~d{x:2}.h>.i,.h~.j{x:3}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> combinator/simple/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> combinator/simple/input.scss
a > b {x: 1}
a + b, c ~ d {x: 2}
li > ol, li > ul {x: 3}
<===> combinator/simple/output.css
a>b{x:1}a+b,c~d{x:2}li>ol,li>ul{x:3}
