================================================================================
<===> supports/parenthesis/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> supports/parenthesis/input.scss
@supports (display: grid) {a {x: 1}}
@supports (display: grid) and (gap: 1px) {b {x: 2}}
<===> supports/parenthesis/output.css
@supports(display: grid){a{x:1}}@supports(display: grid) and (gap: 1px){b{x:2}}
